con cake I was able to try at Toups was INCREDIBLE. It was soft and delicious and so good. The girl at Toups told me that because Debbie delivers cake to them that if I place an order with DDD, they would be happy to deliver whatever cake I order to them so that I can pick it up. Talk about super convenient! I think my next birthday cake will definitely be from Debbie Does Doberge!"},{"business_id":"1hD2VBFITseuN72YvRekpQ","review_id":"cYO7nT5u3fYgRzsnqfip5A","date":"2013-08-13T05:11:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.929140031337738,"text_excerpt":"Thanks to my Yelp buddies I learned about Debbie Does Doberge and where to obtain this delicacy! A college friend of mine who lives in Canada was in town and we decided to go to Toup's for dinner to catch up. Before we even ordered appetizers I informed my friend and the waitress that we were definitely getting a slice of Debbie Does Doberge cake! Now I'm not normally one to order desserts much less rave about them (with the white chocolate bread pudding at the Palace Cafe and the bread pudding with whiskey sauce from Desire as exceptions) but the salted caramel bacon Doberge cake was out of this world! OMFG, our sweet waitress told me about the other different flavored they've had like p..."},{"business_id":"1hD2VBFITseuN72YvRekpQ","review_id":"nJcGJ5Dl51dd3w99025-Pg","date":"2015-04-13T15:43:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9285715818405151,"text_excerpt":"I couldn't have been more excited when Charles of Debbie Does Doberge told me, despite 12 Mile being closed for renovations this past weekend, that Triple Ds was still rollin' out their delicious Doberge cakes. My sister who resides in Portland and is getting married in September had a crawfish boil for friends and family down here that couldn't make the trip, and this traditional New Orleans layered cake was exactly what I wanted for them to enjoy. I looked on their website (which looks great in mobile view) to prep my order to call it in on Thursday to be ready for Saturday. Charles was super pleasant, and let me know what information he needed to make it happen. We ordered 2 8\" cakes f..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"1hD2VBFITseuN72YvRekpQ","photo_id":"K6TZNk1Oc2zUtkGWpLKRsQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/K6TZNk1Oc2zUtkGWpLKRsQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9041464328765869},{"business_id":"1hD2VBFITseuN72YvRekpQ","photo_id":"f_oFT9XJD83X5-tSBBpzjg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/f_oFT9XJD83X5-tSBBpzjg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9033366441726685},{"business_id":"1hD2VBFITseuN72YvRekpQ","photo_id":"OmDc_RlQokQPfvTQOxHzuA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/OmDc_RlQokQPfvTQOxHzuA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9002979397773743},{"business_id":"1hD2VBFITseuN72YvRekpQ","photo_id":"QrFJ7BvC_K0Cz5aIYnEU0A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/QrFJ7BvC_K0Cz5aIYnEU0A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8880153894424438}]},"notebook_case":null}
